---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | St. John of Kronstadt Orthodox Mission"
  description="How St. John of Kronstadt Orthodox Mission, Bayview TX handles your phone number, SMS messages, and website data. We do not sell or share data."
>
  <!-- ==================== PAGE HEADER ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 md:px-6 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-tan-dark">Site Information</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl text-text-primary md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 h-px w-24 bg-liturgical-current"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== OVERVIEW ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Overview</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        St. John of Kronstadt Orthodox Mission operates this website and phone line
        solely to serve our parish community. We do not sell, share, or market your
        data.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== PHONE & SMS ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Phone &amp; SMS</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Our parish phone line at <a href="tel:+19564490225">(956) 449-0225</a> is
        operated through Twilio. When you interact with the line, your phone number
        may be used to send you transactional SMS messages tied directly to that
        interaction — for example, the parish website link when you request it
        through the phone menu, or a confirmation that your voicemail was received.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl text-text-primary">How you opt in</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Opt-in happens when you actively choose a menu option during a call to
        (956) 449-0225 — for example, pressing a key to request the website link —
        or when you leave a voicemail and receive a confirmation. We do not send
        unsolicited or promotional messages. We do not enroll you in any list
        without an action on your part.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl text-text-primary">Message frequency</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Message frequency varies and is tied to your own interactions with the
        phone line. A typical call produces zero to two SMS messages. We do not
        send recurring or campaign-style messages.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl text-text-primary">How to opt out or get help</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to unsubscribe — you will receive
        a single confirmation that no further messages will be sent. Reply
        <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance, or call the parish directly at
        <a href="tel:+19564490225">(956) 449-0225</a>.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl text-text-primary">Costs and delivery</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier and
        plan. Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.
      </p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl text-text-primary">Data handling</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        We do not sell, share, or market your phone number. Phone numbers are
        retained only within Twilio's standard call-log infrastructure for the
        operation of the parish line and are never given to third parties for
        marketing. Opt-in data and consent records are kept only for the purpose
        of honoring opt-out requests and demonstrating compliance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== MESSAGING TERMS OF SERVICE ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">SMS Terms of Service</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        By interacting with the parish phone line in a way that triggers a text
        message (selecting a phone-menu option, or leaving a voicemail), you
        agree to receive transactional SMS messages from St. John of Kronstadt
        Orthodox Mission at the number you used. You can opt out at any time by
        replying <strong>STOP</strong>. You can request help by replying
        <strong>HELP</strong>. Message and data rates may apply. Message
        frequency varies. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered
        messages.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        We will never send promotional, marketing, political, or third-party
        content via SMS. Messages are limited to the operational scope described
        above (website link delivery on request, voicemail confirmations, and
        pastoral voicemail alerts). Your phone number is not shared with anyone
        outside the parish's own telephony provider (Twilio) and is not used for
        any purpose beyond servicing your call.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== WEBSITE ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Website</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        This site collects no personal data and uses no tracking cookies or analytics.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== CONTACT ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Contact</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Questions? Call <a href="tel:+19564490225">(956) 449-0225</a> or use the
        <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> at stjohnrgv.org/contact/.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== LAST UPDATED ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-20 md:px-6 md:pb-24">
      <p class="text-sm italic text-text-secondary">
        Last updated: May 27, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
